  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Restricted Archive Record 17-B
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Restricted Archive Record 17-B
  content: "Classification: Restricted\n\nSubject: Preliminary Observations \u2014
    Waning of Stillness\nThe affected regions exhibit more than extreme snowfall.\nWildlife
    abandons the area first.\nSound gradually diminishes.\nSurvivors report increasing
    resistance to movement despite no visible obstruction.\nProlonged exposure results
    in severe fatigue, disorientation, and eventual immobility.\nFurther study has
    been suspended pending approval from the Grand Archivists."
